# Plans stay outside the Flynn repo

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md).

Working notes, design docs, implementation plans, reviews, and local status
files belong in the **workspace** parent, not under `docs/`:

```
/Users/rgirard/Documents/FlynnWorkspace/.plans/<topic>.md
```

Do not add files to `docs/plans/`, `docs/reviews/`, or `docs/local/` (those
directories were removed). Keep user-facing guides in `docs/content/`. When a
plan is done, leave it in `.plans/` unless the user asks to turn it into a
guide.
